            The ultimate solution for managing users, roles, and permissions with enterprise precision.
        </p>

        <!-- Extended Description -->
        <p class="text-muted fs-6 mb-2">
            Gain complete control over your user base — from creating and editing user profiles, assigning granular permissions, to tracking activity logs and organizing teams. Everything your business needs in one centralized platform.
